{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 83,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Consumer electronics is arguably\nthe most competitive market in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3712,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with its unforgiving business model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5672,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heavy funding requirements,\nand endless disruption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8800,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every vertical is dominated by legacy\nplayers or conglomerates, and even titans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13179,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Microsoft and Sony must fight\nevery year to maintain market share."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17392,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a fast moving landscape\nwhere winners don't stay on top long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20854,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new markets emerge as fast\nas they disappear, and disruption comes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24482,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from all sides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25692,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The combination of hardware and software\nmakes the consumer electronics business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29404,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a juggernaut, with gross margins\nthat are typically half of that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32449,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of SaaS companies with lower profits,\ntransient winners and fragile moats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36828,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's no wonder that most of the headlines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38788,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talent, and investment in the tech industry\nhas flowed towards consumer software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42917,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than consumer electronics\nin the past 20 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46421,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you nailed timing, hardware,\nand software, the impact is revolutionary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50800,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can create a new market\nlike Apple did with smartphones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53845,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bose with noise cancellation\nheadphones, HP with home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57182,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "printers, and Dell with \ndirect to consumer PCs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60560,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These products were game\nchangers and transformed their companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63396,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into global, category-defining powerhouses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66066,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the creation of a new market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67567,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the challengers quickly follow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69069,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they cater to those who are priced out\nby the new leader in smartphones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72781,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Samsung and Xiaomi make up number\ntwo and number three in televisions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76576,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LG and Sony chase\nafter Samsung. And in handhelds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79913,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Steam and Asus have emerged\nhoping to gain ground on Nintendo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83750,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Evolution is critical\nin consumer electronics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86461,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No company is immune to disruption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88713,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IBM invented the smartphone in the 90s,\nbut it was Nokia and BlackBerry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92884,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who dominated in the 2000s,\nbefore being toppled by Apple and Samsung."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97097,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "HP's billion-dollar printer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98765,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "empire has crumbled from e-signatures\nand stronger direct competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102852,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bose's market share has eroded\nsince the mid 2010s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105647,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the entry of Sony, Apple \nand Sonos.  And Dell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108733,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "today is a distant third\nbehind Lenovo and HP."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111903,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this sector, if you stop innovating,\nyou'll be disrupted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115657,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through the 2000s, consumer point-and-shoot\ncameras were a booming category"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119452,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "led by legacy Japanese giants\nlike Canon and Nikon - until smartphones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123957,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cameras today have become\nevery smartphone's greatest selling point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127502,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we look at the iPhone, Pixel,\nor Galaxy launches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130588,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the camera segment alone makes up\nhalf of every keynote."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133925,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple, Google, and Samsung\nhave each invested billions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136761,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make their smartphone cameras\nnot just easy to use, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139848,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also powerful enough to outclass\ntraditional variants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143017,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In response, Nikon, Canon, \nand Sony have retreated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146312,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to their professional niches,\nwhile the smaller players like Kodak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149482,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Olympus have exited\nthe consumer camera market entirely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153194,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the mid 2010s, the notion\nthat there could be a new standalone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156406,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "camera company was unthinkable\nuntil the emergence of GoPro."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160368,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro looked to be\nthat next revolutionary market maker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163454,
    "dDurationMs": 1711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had created and cornered the action"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165165,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "camera market in a way that neither\nsmartphones nor DSLRs could touch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169460,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as we covered a year ago,\nGoPro is nearing extinction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172922,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Innovation has slowed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174215,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product has stagnated, \nsales have plummeted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176885,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "losses have soared, \nand shares have cratered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179554,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Business has gotten so bad\nthat the company has now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182223,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paywalled their editing software\njust to keep the lights on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185310,
    "dDurationMs": 625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As GoPro"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185935,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collapsed, analysts and experts around\nthe world brushed off action cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190148,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyone who wanted one\nalready had bought one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192483,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a dying market - a niche\nthat was so small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195028,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that not even the company that had created\nit could survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198072,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if you create the market,\nyou are not entitled to its future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201492,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Business is about choosing your battles,\nand starting a camera company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204495,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "today is asking for punishment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206539,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd be crushed on\none end by the trillion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208541,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollar titans of Apple and Samsung,\nor smashed on the other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211628,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the entrenched\nold guard of Nikon and Canon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214714,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's left in the middle\nare these niches like action cameras"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217592,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that look too small and too volatile\nto ever sustain a billion dollar business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223014,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Insta360 has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224349,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "done the impossible\nand what many presume to be a dead market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227393,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, they're the youngest,\nmost profitable, and fastest growing camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230855,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maker in the world,\nsurpassing GoPro, Nikon, and Canon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234817,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In ten years, Insta360 has \ngrown from a dorm room idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238238,
    "dDurationMs": 4504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a $10 billion powerhouse\nas the category leader in 360 cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243201,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While you can manipulate hype\nwith software,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245328,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't do the same with hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247330,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 in the past\nfive years has built a powerful moat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250750,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between smartphones\nand professional cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253086,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "earning acclaim from Wired, CES, New York\nTimes, and Japan's Good Design Award."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259008,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their cameras are sold at Apple Stores,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261010,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Best Buys, and Costcos all around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262595,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world, have been endorsed by internet\nstars like Casey Neistat and Corridor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266516,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Digital, and support use cases\nthat extend far beyond extreme sports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271145,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the past 40 years,\nthere have only been two camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273815,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manufacturers to have IPO'd\nand one of them is Insta360."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278278,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While startups today chase headlines,\nInsta360 has stayed quietly product-first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282907,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with soft-spoken founders who have done\nless than a handful of media appearances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287161,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were not the first\nnor the most well-funded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289831,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did they succeed where others failed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291833,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What did they bring to the table\nand how did they create opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294836,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when everyone else saw none?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296838,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To understand how this tiny startup grew\nto a global $10 billion leader in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300883,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just ten years, we asked for\nand were granted access inside the company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304679,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to learn about their unique journey,\nbusiness strategies, and market insight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308933,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this Modern MBA original, we're going\nboots on the ground to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312603,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rise of Insta360,\nhow startups can topple giants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316190,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how product can\nonly be a moat with humility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322822,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does the future hold in business?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324699,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Asked nine experts,\nand you'll get ten answers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327243,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tune in to any news program\nand you'll get pundits talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330121,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about equities, interest rates,\nand inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332540,
    "dDurationMs": 626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333166,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they'll talk about how it's going up\nand then say it's going down in the next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336669,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could someone please\ninvent a crystal ball?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339047,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until then, over 42,000 businesses\nhave future-proofed their business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343134,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with NetSuite by Oracle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344761,
    "dDurationMs": 4963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The number one AI cloud ERP\nbring accounting, finance, inventory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349724,
    "dDurationMs": 4796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and HR into one fluid platform. With one\nunified business management suite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354562,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's one source of truth\ngiving you the visibility and control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357774,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to make quick decisions.\nWith real time insights and forecasting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361736,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're peering into the future\nwith actionable data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364197,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're closing the books in days,\nnot weeks, you're spending"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366866,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less time looking backwards\nand more time on what's next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370078,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Modern MBA is small at the moment,\nbut as soon as we scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373081,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we will need and use NetSuite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374874,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today we're switching things manually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376501,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's gotten harder\nto assess our business health."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378920,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to track production costs, to run\npayroll compliant with multiple states,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382715,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to evaluate profit\nand loss by team and project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385593,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a corporation,\nwe pay tax throughout the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387929,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's a nightmare jumping from system\nto system just to get one answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391724,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are capabilities\nthat only NetSuite provides,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394268,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's a platform\nwe intend to take every advantage of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397146,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether your company is earning millions\nor even hundreds of millions, NetSuite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401067,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "helps you respond to immediate challenges\nand seize your biggest opportunities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405154,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Speaking of opportunity, download the CFO's\nGuide to AI and Machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408950,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Learning at netsuite.com/ModernMBA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413037,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The guide is free to you at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415415,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "netsuite.com/ModernMBA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417959,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "netsuite.com/ModernMBA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423131,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While software is crucial, the consumer electronics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425466,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "business is so difficult\nbecause of the dependance on hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428803,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if you charge for the software,\ngrowth still starts and ends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432348,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from getting your hardware\nin the hands of more and more users."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435560,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you're high-end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436602,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or low-end, it's still all about\nmoving as many units as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440440,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In consumer electronics\ntoday, products are generally released"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443526,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in generations, where every generation\nintroduces new features and improvements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447822,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to entice new users and to convince \nexisting ones to upgrade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451826,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under this model, consumer electronics\nhave a short lifespan as each product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455705,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "peaks at launch, but depreciates\nonce it's replaced by the next generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459917,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every category has its own tempo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461919,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple, Google, Samsung\nhave annual releases for smartphones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465423,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Microsoft, Sony, and Nintendo\nlaunch consoles every 4 to 7 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469302,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Nikon, Sony, and Canon\ngenerally take 2 to 3 for cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473473,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Companies must carefully discount\nprevious generations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476392,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to clear out outdated inventory\nwithout tanking their own market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480229,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while still making the new generation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481856,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so compelling that customers don't end up\nbargain hunting for the older models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486444,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since full-price sales drive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488070,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the highest growth and profits,\nevery generation needs to land at launch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492617,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a tricky line to walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494118,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every new generation creates\nthe greatest opportunity for growth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497288,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it also devalues the previous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499165,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on one hand,\nyou accelerate the commoditization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501834,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your own products while trying\nto surpass the status quo on the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505796,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because R\u0026D costs are front-loaded\nand manufacturing takes time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509425,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the only way to generate ROI is\nto ultimately get products out the door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513804,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the more frequent the release cycle,\nthe less time you have for R\u0026D"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517433,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the harder it is to innovate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519310,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet, sinking more time and money into R\u0026D\nis no guarantee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522730,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of innovation as all products\neventually reach their ceiling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526651,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that happens,\nthe only way to reignite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529070,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "growth is to create and to deliver the\nnext breakthrough before anyone else does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533115,
    "dDurationMs": 668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nintendo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533783,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is one of the only companies in history\nto achieve this in every generation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537537,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting with the Gameboy in the 90s,\nthe DS in the early 2000s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541457,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Wii in the late 2000s,\nand then the Switch in the late 2010s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545920,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro's failure to get this loop right\nwas the main reason behind its collapse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550091,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through the 2010s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551175,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they launched a whopping nine generations\nand 20 different models in ten years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555471,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro believe that because they created\nthe market, they could set the tempo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559392,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what happened was the opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561018,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The market got flooded\nwith too many models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563271,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "improvements between generations became\ntrivial, and the use case never evolved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567608,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "beyond extreme sports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569193,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was no reason to ever buy\nthe latest generation at full price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572863,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The truth is that this is a challenge\nthat everyone in the industry faces and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576534,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's exactly why consumer electronics\ncompanies aggressively diversify at scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581289,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple, Dell, HP, and Dyson\nused the profits from their flagship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585668,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "products to quickly expand\nto adjacent categories and services."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589589,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Given all the variables\nacross manufacturing and research,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592800,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's risky to bet the entire fate of a company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595261,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on getting a single product release\nright year after year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598556,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why Samsung and LG eventually\nexpanded from consumer electronics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602852,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to home appliances and vice versa\nfor Toshiba and Panasonic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607315,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's safer to spread investment across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609275,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more and more categories\nthan it is to concentrate on one or a few."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613404,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has been the industry playbook\nfor over a century."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616115,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even the legacy camera makers\nfollowed the same strategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619535,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nikon started in the 1910s,\nmaking optics for the military."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623331,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Funded by the government contracts, they\neventually expanded to civilian cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627418,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They struck gold in the 1950s\nand pioneered the modular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630504,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SLR system. Even as a new leader \nin film cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634133,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nikon continued to diversify\ninto other emerging niches like laboratory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638596,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "microscopes, precision instruments\nfor semiconductors, and digital cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644185,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while the iPhone has taken billions away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646354,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nikon today is as diversified as ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649190,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cameras contribute\njust a third of the overall business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652318,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Semiconductors account for another third,\nwhile health care and industrial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656238,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make up the rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657406,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their big bet today for growth is metal\n3D printing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660534,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing at all to do with cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662828,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Canon got their breakthrough in the 1940s,\nundercutting the rangefinder camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666791,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "market leader by 40%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668417,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then used those profits\nto branch out into other categories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672046,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, printers are Canon's core business\nand account for over 50% of revenue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676801,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cameras contribute\nless than a quarter of sales,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679136,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while industrial and MRI machines\nmake up the rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682348,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Nikon, Canon is now\nbetting on enterprise manufacturing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686018,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the revenue is stable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687520,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "growth is not tied to upgrades,\nand the market isn't shrinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690815,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like cameras or printers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692942,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Diversification is not greed - it's\nsurvival."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695820,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kodak learned this the hard way\nfrom the 1950s through the 1990s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699573,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were the global leader in film\nand photo printing, but they refused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702993,
    "dDurationMs": 3838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to embrace digital photography out of fear\nof disturbing their golden goose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707123,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the smartphone and digital photos\nwent mainstream, Kodak's entire business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711168,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "became obsolete. With no other revenue\nstreams to fall back on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714547,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they went bankrupt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715756,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If Nikon or Canon had sold just cameras,\nthey most likely would not have survived"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720094,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the smartphone disruption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721637,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro tried to diversify,\nbut took things in the wrong direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725141,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They burned millions\ntrying to reinvent themselves as a media"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727852,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "business, rushed to catch the flavor\nof the month with a failed drone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731147,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and refused to partner\nwith other consumer electronics startups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734692,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time GoPro\nfinally refocused on hardware,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737445,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it had already squandered its capital,\nmomentum, and credibility,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740865,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thus opening the door for Insta360\nto take its place as the new leader."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745828,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one creates a world-changing mass \nmarket product out the gate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748998,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even Apple needed decades of groundwork,\nstarting from the Macintosh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752501,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the way to the iPod\nto get to the iPhone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755463,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No startup can afford to chase the mass market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757840,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or pull off that level of innovation\nfrom day one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760634,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You begin in a niche,\nideally one that's so small that it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763512,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ignored by the incumbents or it's so new\nthat no leader has been established yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767975,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your aim is to deliver a breakout product\nin performance or price, or maybe both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772605,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then with this traction, you can either\ndouble down on the belief that your niche"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775858,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will eventually blossom into a mass-market\nlike semiconductors or printers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779904,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your startup will become more dominant,\nbut on the flip side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782615,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your R\u0026D can end up tunnel visioned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784658,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it may take years, even decades\nbefore the market really grows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788829,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can try to accelerate the market\nlike GoPro did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791624,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with aggressive marketing,\nrapid releases, and deep discounting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795294,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But ultimately, the business will only go\nas far as the market can sustain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800299,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other option is to use your cash flow\nand expertise to expand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803928,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into an adjacent niche,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805262,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take leadership there, and then evaluate\neach market as they grow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809058,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This path carries greater risk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811060,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the upside is that you're following\nmarkets rather than forcing them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814563,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're not banking everything\non getting one single thing right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818067,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can potentially spot\nbigger opportunities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820319,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for innovation and understand\nuser needs across categories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823572,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would not otherwise be visible\nfrom a single vantage point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827326,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The latter is how Insta360 started.\nIn the early 2010s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831205,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "360 degree video was an emerging\ngreenfield niche at the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835376,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Virtual reality was hyped\nas the next big thing in tech."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838963,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "360 video rode these tailwinds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841173,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was seen as a revolutionary medium,\none where viewers were no longer confined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845553,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a frame watching from the outside,\nbut instead placed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848347,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "directly inside the scene\nand free to look in any direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851225,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like in real life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852601,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The potential, in theory, was huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854854,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Video production could break away\nfrom the traditionally rigid composed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858649,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "director-driven shots\nand towards more immersive, viewer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862069,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "based visuals. Because there were\nno headsets or controllers involved,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865614,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "360 video was regarded\nas a crucial stepping stone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868742,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to mass market VR.\nBut creating 360 videos was complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873080,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since there was nothing out of the box\nthat supported 360 video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876458,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "early adopters had to do everything\nthemselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879211,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They built homemade multi-camera rigs\nand then manually stitched"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882381,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the footage themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883632,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But issues like synchronization,\nspatial audio,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886594,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "warping, and blending only made production\nmore difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890139,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 2015, YouTube and Facebook\nsupported playback for 360 video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894393,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and brands like Nike, Disney and NatGeo\ntried their hand at this new medium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899481,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even with platform buy-in,\n360 video was ultimately too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903110,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "primitive for professionals\nand out of reach for the average consumer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907239,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a tiny niche\nthat was accessible for only the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909909,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "technical, well-funded studios and agencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913078,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Canon was reluctant to take chances,\nwhile the tech giants like Facebook"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916707,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Samsung only had eyes\nfor the bigger opportunity in VR headsets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921462,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ricoh, LG and Nikon jumped in,\nbut they all kept their bets tight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925507,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resulting in barebones\nsoftware and hardware products"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928344,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that did very little to innovate\nor to grow the market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931555,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the time, JK was a college student."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933807,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He attended a concert"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934975,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he realized if he\nhad been able to record it in 360,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938354,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he could relive the moments\njust as he had experienced in person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942066,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While most believe that the technology\nwould be limited to VR or commercial use,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946195,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK saw a natural fit for everyday folks\nlike himself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949156,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who wanted to capture moments\nwithout stepping away from the experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952868,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But 360 videos had to be easy to make,\nand no one had been able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956497,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to solve this problem\nend-to-end, from hardware to software."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960668,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a computer science student,\nhe started with what he knew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963587,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "writing code in his dorm room\nto livestream university lessons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967049,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His ability to chip away at the software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969176,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gave him confidence, but he needed funding\nto tackle the hardware side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973097,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A year later, he founded Insta360 in pursuit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975891,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of this vision and brought on Max\nto help with the business side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979311,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But success was not a straight shot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981605,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within their first year, Jake\nand the team had developed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984108,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first ever real-time\nlive stitching algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987277,
    "dDurationMs": 2712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But while they slowly improved\nthe post-production experience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989989,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through software, shooting still demanded\na true modern hardware solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994576,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360's first product,\nthe Nano, was the smallest and cheapest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998247,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "360 camera ever made as a plug-and-play \naccessory for the iPhone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002501,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Footage could be stitched in real\ntime, edited on a mobile app, and could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005963,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also be livestreamed without cables,\ntransfers, or extra devices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009717,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Nano was perceived as a breakthrough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011719,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "winning headlines, awards,\nand even praise from Steve Wozniak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015514,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But commercially, it was a flop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017558,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Nano was a solution\nlooking for a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020227,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was too basic for professionals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022062,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with real production needs and \ntoo niche for casual consumers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025816,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the novelty wore off,\nso did Nano sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028861,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make matters worse, the VR bubble burst"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031238,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just a year later and as that faded, \nso did interest in 360 video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035909,
    "dDurationMs": 5131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tiny niche shrunk even further\nas Nikon, LG, and Kodak exited the field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041373,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a time where everyone \nelse was pulling back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043876,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 stuck around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089046,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Nano proved that \nthey could hang with the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091548,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The real challenge was not execution,\nbut direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094593,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of building what they imagined\npeople would want in the future,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097554,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they focused on building products\nthat people needed right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100474,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK and Max realized\nthat they had been too fixated on trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103769,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to convince people on the value \nof 360 video as a format."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107606,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Technology is a means to an end,\nnot an end in itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111235,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And despite the market-wide contraction,\nthere were still people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114238,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to get value out of their Nanos\nin the real world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145727,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing about the product\nhad been engineered for action sports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148897,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't waterproof."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150107,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It didn't have swappable batteries\nand it couldn't be mounted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152901,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet it was these skiers, cyclists,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155028,
    "dDurationMs": 3546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and athletes that turned out to be\nthe Nano's most loyal adopters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158907,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were all fed up with GoPros.\nWith the 360 cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162119,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could remain in the experience,\ncapture everything in one take,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165497,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then pick the best angles\nin post-production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168000,
    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The freedom they gained outweighed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169459,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the costs of the clunky software\nand unreliable hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172713,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the heels of this insight,\nInsta360 came into its own,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175924,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shedding its early identity\nas a gadget startup and going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179011,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all-in on the ambition\nof becoming a modern camera manufacturer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183056,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its R\u0026D strategy evolved\nas the team shifted away from evangelizing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187060,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the 360 video format itself\nfor the general public and towards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190814,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "developing specific tools that could\nsimplify production for video creators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195319,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 2017,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196403,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 had channeled these insights\ninto a breakthrough proof-of-concept."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200699,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ONE launched with a workflow\nfocus of shoot first, point later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204870,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while GoPro and Ricoh continue\nto chase hardware differentiation and high"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208707,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "end professionals with their 360 cameras,\nInsta360 designed for everyday consumers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214171,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For JK,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215130,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "long-term adoption was far more important\nthan short-term profit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219051,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had conviction that the greatest value-add \nwas in software, not hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223347,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the time, it was a contrarian bet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225557,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even at their prime, legacy manufacturers\nlike Nikon and Canon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229353,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had always exclusively focused on capture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231563,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "streamlining hardware into fewer buttons\nand pushing lenses to new heights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235651,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they always left it up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236652,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to users to piece together\npost-production on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239821,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Across the industry,\nthe hardware was getting better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242282,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the actual software\nexperience remained primitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316106,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK and Max believed that users shouldn't\nhave to be adrenaline"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1319359,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "junkies, extreme athletes, or editing\nwizards to get value out of a camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323989,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while the other camera makers\ncontinued to chase hardware specs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327242,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as their big innovations, Insta360\ndeviated to invest in software."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332122,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ONE at launch was not only 2 times\ncheaper than the GoPro Fusion and $50"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336877,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than the Samsung Gear, but also shipped\nwith a slew of software innovations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341548,
    "dDurationMs": 5339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While GoPro, Ricoh, and Samsung offloaded\nediting onto users just like the legacy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346887,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manufacturers, Insta360\nmade editing part of the product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351141,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ONE pioneered a new standard\nwith mobile-first editing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354353,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reframing out of the box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356271,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Users could scrub through the raw footage,\npick the best"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359024,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shots, and export\nthe finished clips in 2D on their phones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362861,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They no longer needed to wait\nuntil after the shoot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365238,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or to separately budget hundreds of hours\nlearning various"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368241,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "professional editors\njust to produce a single quality clip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371953,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their other software breakthrough\nwas the viral invisible selfie stick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375707,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the first time ever, individuals\ncould pull off these third person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379044,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shots without drones or extra camera operators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382464,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ONE was an immediate hit,\ndoubling Insta360's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385467,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "revenue in what many had presumed\nto be a shrinking niche."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388929,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the momentum finally on their side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390722,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They fast-followed with the X1 in 2018."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393850,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the iPhone had been for smartphones\nand the Wii had been for consoles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397562,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the X1 was that game changer,\ntransforming Insta360"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400982,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a global, category-defining powerhouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404069,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The X1 launched with cutting edge software\nlike real-time stabilization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407781,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and slow motion capabilities\nthat had previously only been achievable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411576,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with high-end gimbals\nand intensive desktop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413954,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "post-processing. Like the invisible selfie\nstick and reframing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417833,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these features were industry-firsts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420085,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seven years later, GoPro and Ricoh,\neven today, are still unable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423964,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to catch up to Insta360's software\nfeature set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1427050,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were also strides in hardware\nbetween the generations with removable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430720,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "batteries, slim candy bar design, \nWi-Fi, and Bluetooth support."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435350,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Consumers began to understand\nthat the true value in 360"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438728,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "video was not necessarily the format,\nbut how it reinvented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442023,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the workflow from traditional cameras\nand smartphones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445152,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the X1, Insta360 achieved\nthe breakout product that every consumer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449406,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electronics startup dreams of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451158,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sales tripled in a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452701,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Apple and BestBuy\nscrambled to carry the X1 in their stores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456663,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Insta360 climbed,\ntheir rivals started to fall behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460750,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro's R\u0026D struggles, failed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462752,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diversification, and stagnant releases\nonly helped fuel Insta360"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467007,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "growth. Even though it was looking \nlike a one horse race,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470093,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK and Max couldn't rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472137,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The X1 had become the face of the company,\nand it needed to be reinforced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476016,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LG, Samsung and Nikon were all watching\nfrom the sidelines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479728,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to gauge the possibility of reentry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482314,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thus, the more ground Insta360\ngained in the space, the faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486109,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had to move to stay ahead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487903,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They turned the X1 into the company's\nflagship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490197,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with each generation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491448,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bringing greater improvements in battery\nlenses, audio and editing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495869,
    "dDurationMs": 5505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between 2018 and 2024, Insta360 released\nfive generations of the X-series"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501374,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alongside next-gen features\nlike object tracking and horizon lock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505545,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In comparison, GoPro in the same period\nlaunched only one generation with no"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509966,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "updates since 2019, and \nRicoh launched only three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513345,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with no updates since 2022."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516389,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 today is the market leader,\nholding a 67% market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520936,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "share with GoPro at 9% and Ricoh at 12%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524898,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the seven years since the X1,\nthe startup has grown from $80 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529528,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in sales to nearly $1 billion, with record\nmargins as a modern camera manufacturer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535242,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The breakthrough X\nseries has been the workhorse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537869,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accounting for over 50% of sales\nevery year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540997,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though the product is now on\nits fifth generation in six years, there's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544751,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zero signs of slowdown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546419,
    "dDurationMs": 793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unit volume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547212,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the main metric used to evaluate\nconsumer hardware companies, and Insta360"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551675,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sells more of its flagship X series\nthan any other product in its portfolio,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555762,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with an average unit volume growth of 50%\nper year in the past four years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561101,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, unit volume is a function of price,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563645,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning that companies can manipulate\nhigher unit volume through aggressive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567440,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discounting to make the numbers\nlook bigger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569651,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not the case\nhere, as the average selling price"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572487,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the X series has increased 17%\nin four years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576283,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alongside these record highs\nin unit volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578952,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, GoPro slashed its average\nselling price by 10%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582998,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet its unit volume still plunged\n30% over the same period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587168,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, the true measure of a category\nleading product is global market fit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591798,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The X-series accounts\nfor over 50% of Insta360 sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595635,
    "dDurationMs": 4838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in every major market, from the UK\nand Germany to the US and Japan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600849,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While most startups\nwould ride the single-hit to a fast IPO"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604144,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like what GoPro did, Insta360\nonce again went against the grain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608273,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "refusing to play it safe\nor to settle for a quick exit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655445,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The X-series will slump one day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657322,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just the lifecycle\nof all consumer electronics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660241,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something new and better will come along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662202,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want to stay on top,\nyou have to be the one to deliver it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665622,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, JK\nand Max chose to hunker down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668583,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reinvest the profits\nfrom the X-series to expand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672212,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this wasn't diversification"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673797,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the legacy camera makers\nwho deliberately pursued completely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677217,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unrelated enterprise markets\nfor the sole purpose of shareholder value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681596,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, Insta360 remains consumer-first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684724,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Professional cameras like the Titan\nand the Pro contribute just 1% of sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689104,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make up even less of the total unit\nvolume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692148,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's only so many studios\nwith a budget for top-of-the-line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695026,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "VR productions\nand state-of-the-art 360 cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698571,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, 87% of revenue flows\nthrough consumer cameras"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702450,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the remaining 13% on accessories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705036,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite passing up this enterprise\ndiversification, the company hasn't missed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708748,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out. If anything, the consumer focus\nhas only worked in its favor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712669,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 today in fundamentals is \nnot just another GoPro."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716423,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the most profitable camera\nmanufacturer in the world, with overall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720176,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "operating margins"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721094,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exceeding those of Canon and Nikon\ndespite their B2B diversification."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725932,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if we separate it out\njust by their camera business,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728810,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 still outperforms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732021,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since 2018, the company has launched\n15 new products across five distinct"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736526,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product lines, excluding its flagship\nX-series and Pro cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740780,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They've entered five new categories - \naction cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743700,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wearable cameras, webcams,\ngimbals, and drone accessories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747704,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But technical innovation\nis no guarantee of commercial success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751583,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was the ONE-RS series,\nwhich was the first ever modular two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755044,
    "dDurationMs": 3838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one action camera, where users\ncould swap lenses to shoot in 4K"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758882,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or 360 on the fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760592,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it was too complex for the everyday"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762427,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grab-and-shoot consumer and too narrow\nfor the professional market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766222,
    "dDurationMs": 4255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unit volumes remained low and the product\nstruggled to generate meaningful sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770643,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then there was the Sphere,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772061,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first-ever consumer grade snap-on 360\ncamera rig for drones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776691,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It brought the trademark stabilization,\nreframing, and invisible selfie stick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780820,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to aerial footage, but the design couldn't\nbe reliably scaled across drone models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785742,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, misses like these \nhave never discouraged JK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789412,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As Insta360 has scaled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791164,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's discovered that in some ways,\nlife is only harder at the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795001,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're a startup,\nyou fight for survival."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797086,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're a leader,\nyou're fighting to stay on top,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1799214,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even as your rivals copy your every move\nand you're still pressured"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802425,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to develop that next breakthrough\nbefore your current one runs out of steam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901900,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Canon and Nikon lost \ntheir consumer camera business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904694,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to smartphones, there was another \nfactor in their decline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908072,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years, they refused to embrace\nmirrorless cameras, believing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911701,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that their multi-billion-dollar DSLR\nempires and ecosystems were invincible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916456,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That complacency and unwillingness\nto even experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919751,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the early 2010s\nset Canon and Nikon back years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923379,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their late start ended up giving Sony\nthe opening to establish itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926799,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the new leader."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1928092,
    "dDurationMs": 5047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether it's GoPro and cameras, Intel\nand CPUs, or Nokia and cell phones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933139,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lesson is the same - product\ncan only be a moat with humility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937477,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just because you made the market today\ndoesn't entitle you to its future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941564,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For JK, there is no world\nwhere Insta360 can afford"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944984,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to rest in a sector where \nleaders get toppled every decade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948404,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only path to survival is innovation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035992,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360's portfolio is a testament\nto that philosophy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039454,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Sphere and the ONE RS\ndid not hit the mark, but other products"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043082,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have propelled Insta360 closer\nto the billion dollar mark in sales,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046919,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a milestone that the company never\nwould have reached on the X-series alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051257,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The GO is the company's second-fastest\ngrowing product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054343,
    "dDurationMs": 4839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Weighing just 20g, the GO features\nhands-free tap-and-go passive recording."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059557,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It enables never-before-seen POVs\nand has become the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062602,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go-to for viral parent and pet creators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065605,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As consumers have trended towards\nauthenticity over adventure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068900,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sales volume for the GO have grown in tandem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071861,
    "dDurationMs": 5088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unit volume has quadrupled in three years\nand today contributes over 15% of sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077283,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet the company's fastest\ngrowing product is its latest, the Ace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081537,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As GoPro stumbles,\nmore and more of their users"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2083915,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are jumping ship\nand Insta360 is going for the crown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2153526,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Ace has grown 85% in sales volume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156279,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from 40,000 units in its debut\nto a quarter of a million the year after."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2161075,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together, the Go and the Ace contribute\n25% of company sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165621,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by measure of unit volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2167039,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 has already surpassed Nikon, but\nstill has yet to reach GoPro and canon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172336,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But unit volume alone can be misleading."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2174922,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro sells millions of cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176632,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they lose tens of dollars\non every camera that they sell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2179760,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nikon and Canon generate the most,\nwith hundreds to thousands of dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2183681,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in operating profit per camera sold,\nand Insta360 sits in the middle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2188227,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with tens of dollars in profit\nper camera sold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191522,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPros business is driven more by shelf\npresence and impulse gifting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195193,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the vast majority of its products\nare sold every year through retail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2199071,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, Insta360 has built\nits business evenly across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2202825,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both channels, with a 50/50 split\nbetween online and offline"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257338,
    "dDurationMs": 459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "markets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257797,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's another bigger\nopportunity for those who keep building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2261759,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We visited Insta360 HQ the week after their IPO."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2265680,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Besides unreleased products,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2267223,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was nothing we filmed or asked\nthat was ever off limits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270685,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While most founders and execs would be out\ncelebrating, JK and Max were in office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275314,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working the same hours and meetings\nas everyone else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2278693,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To them, going public is not the end of the journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2281487,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the beginning of greater\npossibilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360024,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Facebook, DJI, and Xiaomi\nall moving into cameras,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2363736,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK only sees more competition,\nnot less, for Insta360 in the near future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2369033,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In consumer electronics, the most\ndangerous game to be is in a price war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2372912,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the only innovation is seeing\nwho can sell the same product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2376082,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the lowest price\nwithout going out of business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2379293,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what has happened in TVs,\nmonitors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382254,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keyboards, and even robot vacuums,\nwhere the products have become so mature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2386175,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and homogenous that consumers are \nbuying solely on cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2389929,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To avoid this, innovation\ncan't be incremental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392556,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rather than a conventional 30%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394475,
    "dDurationMs": 5339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "50% of all of Insta360 employees today\nwork in R\u0026D and have a direct"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2399814,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hand in developing hardware or software.\nAt a scale of 3000+ employees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404944,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "innovation now must be systemic\nrather than a roll of the dice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484315,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK has never forgotten what \nit took for Insta360"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2487234,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to survive, but innovation isn't dreamt up\non a whiteboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2490654,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "True insight, just like from the Nano\ndays, comes from being in the field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2494450,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and listening,\nobserving and recognizing what users need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2498329,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With offices in Berlin, Tokyo, Shenzhen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501749,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hong Kong, and Los Angeles,\nInsta360 hosts events worldwide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2505753,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they're not for marketing,\nbut for R\u0026D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2508506,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good ideas can come from anywhere,\nand no community"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2511509,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is ever too niche."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557596,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of stepping up their own R\u0026D,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2559557,
    "dDurationMs": 4504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GoPro chose lawsuits, accusing Insta360\nof exploiting their technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2564478,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a strange claim to make,\nand the latest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2566605,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a series of questionable decisions\nfrom GoPro leadership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570234,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If GoPro had been the first to market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2572027,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with these innovations, then Insta360\nwould not have had the opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2575948,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to grow to where it is today and GoPro\nwouldn't be struggling as badly either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2580578,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "14 months in, and the International Trade\nCommission has reached"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2583789,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same conclusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2585165,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They ruled that there was \nnot only no infringement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2587293,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that GoPros tech\npatents in themselves were invalid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2590212,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only valid complaint was a design\npattern,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2592715,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but design patents are generally drawn\nbroadly and only protect the appearance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2597011,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598304,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and no one's buying cameras\nbased on how they look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2601181,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For Jacob, this ruling has only reaffirmed\nhis core belief that innovation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2605185,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trumps all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606103,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And 10 years in, he's as driven\nas when he first started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609607,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's not looking at yachts,\nstomping around the office,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612234,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with an entourage, and \nmaking grand entrances into meetings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2615779,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only decoration in his office\nis a fish tank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2618449,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But instead of exotic trophy\nfish, it's stocked with cheap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2621744,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "50-cent minnows, a reminder of humility\nand his own beginnings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2669667,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What excites him is not money,\nbut the pursuit and the thrill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2672670,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of capturing the unseen\nand building the unimaginable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675673,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether it's a flight of an eagle\nor a satellite orbiting outer space,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2679635,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "JK is still an engineer at heart,\nand he comes alive in the field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2683514,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, he's testing the world's\nfirst ever drone that shoots in 8K 360,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2687976,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fits in your palm, and weighs just 249g."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2691939,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the newest product from a new drone\nbrand incubated by the company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2696402,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the X1 before, the AntiGravity \nA1 is designed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2699780,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to redefine the workflows for enthusiasts\nand first timers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2703409,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Users don't need to be master pilots\nor to spend extra time after the shoot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2707287,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "editing the drone out of their shots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2709289,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With no joysticks or complex manuals,\nyou just point and press"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2712543,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a single motion controller to fly\nwhere you want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2715421,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With 360 degree head tracking and live\nstreaming goggles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2718632,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see every angle even while flying\nin a completely different direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2723053,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With camera lenses at the top\nand the bottom rather than in the front,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2726557,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it utilizes Insta360's trademark shoot first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2729560,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "frame, later approach and invisible selfie\nstick effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2732771,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all the lessons\nand imaging tech from the X series"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2735607,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "applied into the complex, clunky,\nfragmented world of consumer drones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2740612,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To go from a dorm room idea to \nthe world's fastest growing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2743574,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and most profitable\ncamera maker in ten years isn't luck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2746702,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's perseverance and execution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2749037,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In an era where startups have become cash\ngrabs, where founders love the spotlight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2753125,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than their own companies,\nand innovation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2755461,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means doing the least amount of work\nfor the most money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2758380,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 is a breath of fresh air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2761341,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very few companies and founders today\nrecognize how damaging the modern, short-term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2766555,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shareholder-first, quarter-to-quarter mentality is,\nand that recognition alone sets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2770601,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insta360 apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2772227,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Innovation is what's kept them alive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2774146,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking them to the top and will be\nthe only thing that keeps them there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2777900,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stop innovating\nand they'll lose everything they built."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2780652,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think too small\nand they'll miss the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2783030,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This simple truth has shaped\nnot only the founders, but has been woven"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2786408,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the DNA of Insta360, its people,\nand its products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2790829,
    "dDurationMs": 4672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rise of Insta360 is a modern case\nstudy of how a startup can topple giants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2795542,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why humility is actually the most\nimportant prerequisite to innovation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2799296,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how business is won\nby those who build and adapt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2802633,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In ten years they've done the impossible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2804676,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thriving as a consumer camera manufacturer\nin the age of smartphones, rising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2809431,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to become a category leader\nand redefining the future of video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2812726,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the next generation\nof adventurers, creators, and consumers."
    } ]
  } ]
}
